/// REALITY egress: all locally-redirected outbound traffic (captured via the
/// `egress-redirect` dokodemo-door inbound + iptables OUTPUT REDIRECT) leaves
/// through this VLESS+REALITY client outbound, wrapped to look like ordinary
/// TLS to the oracle decoy VPS, which unwraps and forwards it onward. Sourced
/// from the OVH failover IP (15.235.37.41) rather than the primary public IP.
